[65.469367, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[3;4H\u001b[90m│\u001b[m \u001b[1mCase                                                            \u001b[m \u001b[90m│\u001b[m \u001b[1mExpect\u001b[m \u001b[90m│\u001b[m \u001b[1mESCU            \u001b[m \u001b[90m│\r\n\u001b[3C├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────┼──────────────────┤\r\n\u001b[3C│\u001b[m Real attack-data event: rundll32 comsvcs.dll MiniDump 868 … full \u001b[90m│\u001b[m match  \u001b[90m│\u001b[m should fire\u001b[6C\u001b[90m│\r\n\u001b[3C├\u001b[6;16H─\u001b[6;71H┼\u001b[6;80H┼\u001b[6;99H┤\u001b[m        \r\n\u001b[5CCrafted: comsvcs.dll,#+24                                        \u001b[90m│\u001b[m match  \u001b[90m│\u001b[m should miss      \u001b[90m│\u001b[m        \u001b[8;16H\u001b[90m─\u001b[8;71H┼\u001b[8;80H┼\u001b[8;99H┤\u001b[m        \r\n\u001b[5CCrafted: comsvcs.dll,#65560 (wrapped ordinal for 24)\u001b[9;71H\u001b[90m│\u001b[m match  \u001b[90m│\u001b[m should miss\u001b[6C\u001b[90m│\u001b[7C\u001b[m \u001b[10;16H\u001b[90m─\u001b[10;71H┼\u001b[10;80H┼\u001b[10;99H┤"]
[65.469375, "o", "\u001b[m        \r\n\u001b[5CCrafted: comsvcs.dll,#-65512                                     \u001b[90m│\u001b[m match  \u001b[90m│\u001b[m should miss\u001b[6C\u001b[90m│\u001b[7C\u001b[m \r\n   \u001b[90m├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────┼──────────────────┤\u001b[7C\u001b[m \r\n   \u001b[90m│\u001b[m Crafted: comsvcs.dll,RegisterComponent (no dump)                 \u001b[90m│\u001b[m none   \u001b[90m│\u001b[m should be silent \u001b[90m│\u001b[m        \r\n   \u001b[90m└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴────────┴──────────────────┘\u001b[7C\u001b[m \u001b[B \u001b[1K\r\n   I built each crafted event by changing only the CommandLine of the real EID 1 event. For the benign case\r\n"]
[65.469388, "o", "   I also replaced the ParentCommandLine, because the real event's parent was the PowerShell MiniDump\u001b[5C \r\n   command.                                                                                                \u001b[B \u001b[1K\r\n   The ESCU column is what I expect from reading its logic. I haven't run these cases through ESCU yet. CI \r\n   will do that on the comparison, so the real result comes from the PR report.                            \u001b[B \u001b[1K\r\n   I did not add a test for a renamed rundll32 with no \u001b[37m rundll32 \u001b[m in the command line. That variant needs    ┃\r\r\n   Image and OriginalFileName changed as well, which goes beyond a CommandLine-only edit.\u001b[17C \u001b[B \u001b[1K\r\n   Want me to branch, commit, push and open the PR so CI runs?                                             \r\u001b[6B \u001b[1m←\u001b[m open sidebar · Interactive · Allow All · \u001b[1m/\u001b[m commands · \u001b[1m?\u001b[m help · \u001b[1mtab\u001b[m next tab\u001b[30;3H\u001b[?25h"]
