[174.387003, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[3;4Hexclusion as the ProcDump and Mimikatz detections.\r\n\u001b[108C\u001b[1K\r\n   • \u001b[1mWhy it is narrow:\u001b[m it needs the account\u001b[5;53Hhost together, so the same dump from any other user or \r\n     any other host still alerts.                                                                      \r\n   • \u001b[1mApproval:\u001b[m the macro description cites the SOC lead's CHG-2077 approval for the other two detections,   \r\n     and says this one was applied at your request. If CHG-2077 doesn't cover this detection, the wording\r\n\u001b[5Cmay need your correction.\r\n\u001b[108C\u001b[1K\r\n   \u001b[1mCI result\u001b[m                \r\n\r\n   \u001b[90m┌────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────┐\r\n\u001b[3C│\u001b[m \u001b[1mCheck                         \u001b[m \u001b[90m│\u001b[m \u001b[1mResult                           \u001b[m \u001b[90m│\u001b[m                               \r\n   \u001b[90m├──────────────"]
[174.387021, "o", "──────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┤\r\n\u001b[3C│\u001b[m Test cases                     \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 12/12 pass                        \u001b[90m│\u001b[m                                   \r\n   \u001b[90m├────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┤\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[m  \u001b[90m│\u001b[m Noise (7 days)                 \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 0 alerts, down from 16 (budget 5) \u001b[90m│\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[m  \u001b[90m├────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┤\r\n\u001b[3C│\u001b[m New none case, purple-team run \u001b[90m│\u001b[m ours silent, ESCU fires\u001b[20;73H\u001b[90m│\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[m  \u001b[90m└───────────────────"]
[174.387031, "o", "─────────────┴───────────────────────────────────┘\u001b[32C\u001b[m   \u001b[B\u001b[1K\r\n   The three ordinal variants (\u001b[37m #+24 \u001b[m, \u001b[37m #65560 \u001b[m, \u001b[37m #-65512 \u001b[m) still fire only on ours, not on ESCU.\u001b[6C     \u001b[B\u001b[1K\r\n   The merge is not done. \u001b[37m gh pr merge \u001b[m deploys to production and needs your approval. Tell me when you want ┃\r\r\n   to merge.                                          \u001b[30;3H\u001b[?25h"]
