[190.586928, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[3;27r\u001b[27;1H\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[r\u001b[15;4H\u001b[37m gh \u001b[m stopped the merge:\u001b[83C┃\r\r\n\u001b[109C┃\r\r\n   \u001b[37m CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED: gh pr merge 3 requires approval. Rerun the same command with --yes after \u001b[9C\u001b[m┃\r\r\n   \u001b[37mapproval. \u001b[96C\u001b[m┃\r\r\n\u001b[109C┃\r\r\n   Merging deploys this detection to production Enterprise Security. This is the command I would run:\u001b[8C┃\r\r\n\u001b[109C┃\r\r\n   \u001b[36mgh pr merge 3 --squash --delete-branch --yes\u001b[62C\u001b[m┃\r\r\n\u001b[109C┃\r\r\n   Reply to approve it and I'll run exactly that. Then I'll follow the \u001b[37m deploy \u001b[m workflow, confirm in Splunk  ┃\r\r\n   that the detection is enabled, scheduled and a correlation search, and run it once over the last 24\u001b[7C┃\r\r\n   hours.\u001b[100C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[109C┃\u001b[m\r\r\n\r\n\r\n❯ \u001b[?25h"]
