[227.034785, "o", "raps the\r\n     dump. This is the encoded-PowerShell parent chain from the attack data.                                \r\n   • \u001b[1mPurple-team exclusion:\u001b[m no \u001b[37m svc_purpleteam \u001b[m rows appear, so the tuning works.\r\n\u001b[108C\u001b[1K\r\n   Many of these hits probably come from the CI replays of my crafted test events (timestamps 16:15 to 17:15\r\n   UTC), not from real activity. I haven't checked which index they came from.\u001b[30;3H\u001b[?25h"]
